(c3) Come,(e) Ho(f)ly(ed) Ghost,(e) Cre(fe)a(h)tor(ih) blest,(h.) (;) Vouch(h)safe(e) wi(f)thin(h) our(ih) souls(i) to(ji) rest;(i.) (:) Come(h) with(ij) thy(hg) grace(fe) and(hi) heaven(e)ly(f) aid,(h.) (;) And(gh) fill(f) the(ed) hearts(f) which(fgf) thou(e) hast(de) made.(e.) (::)
